/* VOCABULARY – every word, phrase and sentence the trainers use, lesson by lesson.

     lesson('Nov 24')     starts a new lesson (used by the lesson filters)
     add(category, [ [German, English, [other accepted German], [other accepted English]], … ])
     addForms([ [verb, [ich, du, er/sie/es, wir, ihr, sie/Sie]] ])  adds the conjugated forms as cards;
                          their English comes from enForms (add it with Object.assign(enForms,{…}))
     labels               display names of the categories

   APPEND ONLY. A word's id is its position in this list, and your saved progress and
   learning history point to those ids. Put a new lesson at the end, just above
   "end of lessons". Never insert in the middle, reorder or delete entries
   (to hide a word, archive it in the app instead).
*/
